# 🔎 Network Troubleshooting Method

A structured troubleshooting sequence used during the lab was:

```text
Check IP configuration
        ↓
Check default gateway
        ↓
Test external IP
        ↓
Test hostname
        ↓
Test DNS directly
```

Example:

```cmd
ipconfig /all
ping 10.0.2.2
ping 8.8.8.8
ping google.com
nslookup google.com
```

This approach helps isolate whether a problem is related to:

* IP configuration
* Local network connectivity
* Default gateway
* Internet connectivity
* DNS resolution

