# 🧠 Troubleshooting Logic

An important diagnostic distinction practiced today was:

```text
ping 8.8.8.8 works
+
ping google.com fails
        ↓
Investigate DNS
```

Whereas:

```text
ping 8.8.8.8 fails
        ↓
Investigate network connectivity
        ↓
Check IP / gateway / adapter / NAT
```

This prevents immediately blaming DNS or the Internet without gathering evidence.

